    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρηγόρητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unconsoled,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; <i>admitting of no consolation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμφορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					7.6.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not to be controlled,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				798
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
