				6
			</span></i>; <i>inexorable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Decent.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>inflexibly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.196
				</span></i>
			.</div>
